' 正例：加新类扩展
interface IDiscountPolicy {
  +apply(price : decimal) : decimal
}
class RegularPolicy implements IDiscountPolicy
class VipPolicy implements IDiscountPolicy
class OrderService {
  -policy : IDiscountPolicy
  +checkout() : decimal
}
OrderService --> IDiscountPolicy
note right of OrderService : 新折扣 = 新类\n旧代码一个字不动
